#. +> trunk
#: importwizard/preprocessingpage.cpp:155
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<qt>"
"<p>Now, we will pre-process bracketed images before fusing them.</p>"
"<p>To perform auto-alignment, <b>%1</b> program from <a href='%2'>%3</a> project will be used. Alignment must be performed if you haven't used a tripod to take bracketed images. Alignment operation can take a while.</p>"
"<p>Pre-processing operations include Raw demosaicing. Raw images will be converted to 16-bit sRGB images with auto-gamma."
"<p>Press \"Next\" button to start pre-processing.</p>"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""

